 {
  "lang": "es",
  "en": "Octéo is an above-ground automatic slatted cover. The roller sits on the pool deck between two sculpted cast-aluminium legs that house the 24 V motor, and the cover glides over the water at the turn of a key or from your phone. It keeps the pool clean, reduces heat loss and evaporation, and secures the pool to the French NF P90-308 safety standard. Choose from four leg finishes and four slat colours, with optional solar-powered LED lighting in both legs.",
  "text": "Octéo es una cubierta automática de lamas elevada. El enrollador se sitúa en la playa de la piscina entre dos patas esculpidas de aluminio fundido que alojan el motor de 24 V, y la cubierta se desliza sobre el agua con solo girar una llave o desde el móvil. Mantiene la piscina limpia, reduce la pérdida de calor y la evaporación, y protege la piscina conforme a la norma de seguridad francesa NF P90-308. Elige entre cuatro acabados de patas y cuatro colores de lamas, con iluminación LED solar opcional en ambas patas."
 },
 {
  "lang": "sv",
  "en": "Octéo is an above-ground automatic slatted cover. The roller sits on the pool deck between two sculpted cast-aluminium legs that house the 24 V motor, and the cover glides over the water at the turn of a key or from your phone. It keeps the pool clean, reduces heat loss and evaporation, and secures the pool to the French NF P90-308 safety standard. Choose from four leg finishes and four slat colours, with optional solar-powered LED lighting in both legs.",
  "text": "Octéo är ett automatiskt lamellskydd ovan mark. Rullen står på pooldäcket mellan två skulpterade ben i gjuten aluminium som rymmer 24 V-motorn, och skyddet glider över vattnet med ett vrid på nyckeln eller från mobilen. Det håller poolen ren, minskar värmeförlust och avdunstning och säkrar poolen enligt den franska säkerhetsstandarden NF P90-308. Välj mellan fyra benfinisher och fyra lamellfärger, med soldriven LED-belysning i båda benen som tillval."
