 {
  "lang": "es",
  "en": "A discreet full-inverter heat pump with a swivelling top, for pools up to 95 m³.",
  "text": "Una bomba de calor full inverter discreta con parte superior giratoria, para piscinas de hasta 95 m³."
 },
 {
  "lang": "sv",
  "en": "A discreet full-inverter heat pump with a swivelling top, for pools up to 95 m³.",
  "text": "En diskret värmepump med full inverter och vridbar topp, för pooler upp till 95 m³."
 },
 {
  "lang": "es",
  "en": "The Z350iQ is designed to blend in. Its innovative swivelling top and 45° water connections make it easy to integrate and install, and it blows air vertically, away from neighbours and seating areas. Full-inverter technology, built-in Wi-Fi with app control and a titanium heat exchanger make it efficient, connected and salt-water compatible. Made in Italy.",
  "text": "La Z350iQ está diseñada para integrarse en su entorno. Su innovadora parte superior giratoria y sus conexiones de agua a 45° facilitan la integración y la instalación, y expulsa el aire en vertical, lejos de vecinos y zonas de estar. La tecnología full inverter, el wifi integrado con control por app y el intercambiador de titanio la hacen eficiente, conectada y compatible con agua salada. Fabricada en Italia."
 },
 {
  "lang": "sv",
  "en": "The Z350iQ is designed to blend in. Its innovative swivelling top and 45° water connections make it easy to integrate and install, and it blows air vertically, away from neighbours and seating areas. Full-inverter technology, built-in Wi-Fi with app control and a titanium heat exchanger make it efficient, connected and salt-water compatible. Made in Italy.",
  "text": "Z350iQ är designad för att smälta in. Den innovativa vridbara toppen och vattenanslutningarna i 45° gör den enkel att placera och installera, och den blåser ut luften vertikalt, bort från grannar och sittplatser. Full inverter-teknik, inbyggt wifi med appstyrning och en värmeväxlare i titan gör den effektiv, uppkopplad och kompatibel med saltvatten. Tillverkad i Italien."
 },
