 {
  "lang": "sv",
  "en": "A distinctive, quiet heat pump for pools up to 145 m³, in aluminium grey or stainless steel.",
  "text": "En särpräglad, tyst värmepump för pooler upp till 145 m³, i aluminiumgrått eller rostfritt stål."
 },
 {
  "lang": "es",
  "en": "The Z400iQ stands out with its unique furniture-like design, and it is quiet and discreet in use, with a two-speed fan and automatic noise reduction. Built-in Wi-Fi lets you control it from your phone, and it can be switched on and off from a remote control or home-automation system. It is available in aluminium grey or with a 316L stainless-steel front panel, and it works down to −12 °C. Made in Europe.",
  "text": "La Z400iQ destaca por su diseño único, como un mueble, y es silenciosa y discreta en funcionamiento, con un ventilador de dos velocidades y reducción automática del ruido. El wifi integrado te permite controlarla desde el móvil, y se puede encender y apagar con un mando a distancia o un sistema domótico. Está disponible en gris aluminio o con un panel frontal de acero inoxidable 316L, y funciona hasta −12 °C. Fabricada en Europa."
 },
 {
  "lang": "sv",
  "en": "The Z400iQ stands out with its unique furniture-like design, and it is quiet and discreet in use, with a two-speed fan and automatic noise reduction. Built-in Wi-Fi lets you control it from your phone, and it can be switched on and off from a remote control or home-automation system. It is available in aluminium grey or with a 316L stainless-steel front panel, and it works down to −12 °C. Made in Europe.",
  "text": "Z400iQ sticker ut med sin unika, möbelliknande design, och den är tyst och diskret i drift, med en tvåhastighetsfläkt och automatisk ljudreducering. Inbyggt wifi gör att du kan styra den från mobilen, och den kan slås av och på med fjärrkontroll eller via ett hemautomationssystem. Den finns i aluminiumgrått eller med en frontpanel i rostfritt stål 316L och fungerar ned till −12 °C. Tillverkad i Europa."
 },
