 {
  "lang": "es",
  "en": "A ground-anchored pool ladder in AISI-304L stainless steel with a Plascoat treatment for extra protection against corrosion and rust, ideal for pools with salt chlorination. Specially designed anti-slip steps, polished cover plate, and supplied with anchors and an earthing connection.",
  "text": "Una escalera de piscina anclada al suelo en acero inoxidable AISI-304L con tratamiento Plascoat para una protección extra contra la corrosión y el óxido, ideal para piscinas con cloración salina. Peldaños antideslizantes de diseño especial, embellecedor pulido, y se suministra con anclajes y conexión a tierra."
 },
 {
  "lang": "sv",
  "en": "A ground-anchored pool ladder in AISI-304L stainless steel with a Plascoat treatment for extra protection against corrosion and rust, ideal for pools with salt chlorination. Specially designed anti-slip steps, polished cover plate, and supplied with anchors and an earthing connection.",
  "text": "En markförankrad poolstege i rostfritt stål AISI-304L med Plascoat-behandling för extra skydd mot korrosion och rost, idealisk för pooler med saltklorering. Specialdesignade halkfria steg, polerad täckplatta, och levereras med ankare och jordanslutning."
 },
